{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>See now that I, I am He.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, answers the enemies: You say, 'Where is our Elohim?' — See now that I am your Elohim; I am He who will show you My might. And [as for] what you join other divinities to Me —" "<b>And there is no Elohim with Me.</b> But rather: 'I kill and I give life' — in My hand to kill and to give life. And if I killed, I Myself give them life." "<b>I strike and I heal.</b> And regarding what you said, 'Let them arise and help you' — there is none who can help them, for I alone will help them; but as for you — none delivers from My hand."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:56.429110560Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}